.TH cfbench 1  "cfbench 0.4.0 (Cloudflare Speedtest v1.13.0, 5954dee4cc83548a9e5031140df4548f71cd1458)" 
.SH NAME
cfbench \- An unofficial native Cloudflare\-compatible speed test CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcfbench\fR [\fB\-\-ipv4\fR] [\fB\-\-ipv6\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-download\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-upload\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-loaded\-latency\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-metadata\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-rpki\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
An unofficial native speed test using Cloudflare\-compatible methodology.
.PP
Because native HTTP timing differs from browser timing, results are not expected to be numerically identical to speed.cloudflare.com.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-ipv4\fR
Use IPv4 only
.TP
\fB\-\-ipv6\fR
Use IPv6 only
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit versioned JSON to stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-download\fR
Skip download measurements
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-upload\fR
Skip upload measurements
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-loaded\-latency\fR
Disable latency probes during transfers
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-metadata\fR
Skip the default public IP and network metadata request.

Metadata collection is enabled by default and includes the public IP, ASN, and approximate location already visible to Cloudflare. \-\-no\-metadata skips the request entirely and omits those metadata fields from output.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<SECONDS>\fR [default: 30]
Per\-request timeout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress normal output; report status with the exit code
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show per\-request measurement progress
.TP
\fB\-\-rpki\-check\fR
Perform an informational reachability probe to Cloudflare\*(Aqs RPKI\-invalid route
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
cfbench\-completions(1)
Generate a shell completion script
.TP
cfbench\-man(1)
Generate the cfbench(1) manual page
.TP
cfbench\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.4.0 (Cloudflare Speedtest v1.13.0, 5954dee4cc83548a9e5031140df4548f71cd1458)
